Projector -> DB : Commit generic tool_call
Projector --> UI : agent.tool_call
note right of UI
  Ordinary tool card only.
  No task progress derived from calls.
end note
== 2. Execute and commit the result ==
Loop -> Todo : Validate; execute(args)
alt Valid complete list
  Todo --> Loop : AgentToolResult with one JSON text block
  Loop -> Projector : Existing TurnEndEvent with tool results
  Projector -> Projector : Validate final success; map full TODO snapshot
  Projector -> Projector : Build both events; validate payloads and sizes
  Projector -> DB : One transaction: ToolResult Entry +\nagent.tool_result + agent.todo_updated
  DB --> Projector : Committed
  Projector --> UI : agent.tool_result (isError=false)
  Projector --> UI : agent.todo_updated (full todos)
  UI -> UI : Replace todos for sourceEventId
  note right of UI
  No tool-name matching or result JSON parsing.
  Each public event has a distinct eventId.
  end note
else Invalid or failed
  Todo --> Loop : Existing tool error path
  Loop -> Projector : Existing TurnEndEvent with failed result
  Projector -> DB : Commit failed generic result
  Projector --> UI : agent.tool_result (isError=true)
  note right of UI : No task event; keep previous list
end
note over Loop,UI
  Ordinary thinking, messages and business tools
  continue.
  No confirmation idle, new segment, mode update
  or TODO endpoint.
  Each later update replaces the list; actual
  execution terminal stays independent.
end note
== 3. Rebuild the same projection ==
UI -> History : GET Events
History -> DB : Read stored events including task snapshots
